OL,3,AEvacuees from Russia-occupied city
OL,4,Awhere residents ate weeds on way to
OL,5,AUkraine
OL,6,
OL,7,FPeople evacuated from the devastated
OL,8,FRussian-occupied city of Oleshky have
OL,9,Farrived in Belarus and are expected
OL,10,Fback in Ukraine later on Saturday,
OL,11,Fauthorities have said.
OL,13,FResidents of the frontline city had
OL,14,Fbeen trapped without food, water and
OL,15,Felectricity, with many resorting to
OL,16,Fcooking garden weeds to survive.
OL,18,FThe evacuees were taken out of Oleshky
OL,19,Fon Friday during a local ceasefire
OL,20,Fbrokered by US First Lady Melania
OL,21,FTrump.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
