OL,3,AEvacuees from Russia-occupied city
OL,4,Awhere residents ate weeds on way to
OL,5,AUkraine
OL,6,
OL,7,FPlanes carrying the residents landed in
OL,8,Fthe city of Gomel on Saturday morning,
OL,9,Faccording to Belarusian state media and
OL,10,Fa senior Ukrainian official.
